<title>USA: Investor lifts stake in Allied Healthcare.</title>
<headline>Investor lifts stake in Allied Healthcare.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor John Weil of St. Louis said Thursday he had raised his stake in Allied Healthcare Products Inc to 500,300 shares, or 6.42 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Weil said he bought 95,000 shares between August 21 and September 3 at prices ranging from $6.375 to $6.4375 each.</p>
<p>Weil said the shares were purchased for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
